00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:00.760
Thật không ạ?

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.500
Muốn hô fighting cùng các chị không nè?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.490
Cùng hô "Fighting! Fighting! Fighting! Hô!" nhé~

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:07.770
Bắt đầu nào!

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:08.670
ILLIT

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.060
ILLIT~

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:11.410
Fighting! Fighting! Fighting!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.950
Hôôô~

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:15.920
[Xoa đầu]
[Làm tốt lắm, mấy bé little monster à~]
